  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Commonwealth of Learning 2024-25 to 2026-27</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Commonwealth of Learning, one of the three principal organs of the Commonwealth, delivers education outcomes for Commonwealth members including increased access to tertiary education with associated increases in human development. This multi-year funding agreement will ensure Commonwealth of Learning has funding certainty in order to continue its activities that benefit all Commonwealth members, and in particular small developing countries in the Pacific, Africa and the Caribbean.</narrative>
  </description>
